<title>USA: TABLE - TriMas Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - TriMas Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in Thousands Except per Share Data</p>
<p>					Q2		    Six Months</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	    $182,840   $160,200   $347,060   $307,900</p>
<p> Cost of Sales	(122,350)  (106,740)  (234,030)  (206,980)</p>
<p> Operating  Profit    34,680   30,590     61,110     55,060</p>
<p> Income Taxes	   13,200     11,390     23,050     20,430</p>
<p> Net Income	     21,550     17,820     37,720     31,950</p>
<p>Primary Earnings</p>
<p>  per common share	0.52	 0.48	 0.95	 0.86</p>
<p>Fully Diluted Earnings</p>
<p>  per share		 0.52	 0.45	 0.91	 0.80</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares:</p>
<p>	Primary	   41,663     36,983     39,663     39,968</p>
<p>	Fully Diluted   41,673     42,065     41,673     42,065</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 and six-month shares outstanding reflect the conversion and redemption of $115 million of convertible subordinated debentures during Q1 1997, including $106 million of debentures into 4.7 million shares.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
